# Football Prognoz

- UI (`src/football_prognoz/ui/`) talks only to `services/` and `domain/`. Never call `httpx` or SQLite from a view.
- New HTTP APIs: document in `docs/DATA_SOURCES.md` first (URL, limits, fields), then write a client in `data/`.
- Do not replace the local 1X2 model with ChatGPT. The LLM only explains facts + probabilities.
- Cache every network response in SQLite. Respect football-data.org 10 req/min.
- Code and commit messages in English. UI strings in Russian.
- Never commit `.env`, `data/cache/`, downloaded CSVs, or API keys. Do not log secrets.
- Official docs first: `docs/DOC_STUDY.md`. Do not invent football-data.org v4 JSON fields.
- Do not add LangChain/LlamaIndex. One direct OpenAI or Ollama call.
- Show a UI disclaimer: statistical forecast, not betting advice.
